OL,3,GNEWSADo not speculate about girl's
OL,4,Adeath, public asked
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been urged not to speculate
OL,7,Fover the unexplained death of an
OL,8,F11-year-old girl.
OL,10,FIt comes after West Mercia Police
OL,11,Fconfirmed no third party was being
OL,12,Fsought in connection with the incident
OL,13,Fin Elmley Castle, near Evesham,
OL,14,FWorcestershire.
OL,16,FThe girl's body was discovered in a
OL,17,Fpark near the village cricket ground
OL,18,Fafter she was reported missing at about
OL,19,F23:20 BST on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
